{"ok":true,"module":"io/output/d17","docs":{"io/output/d17/binding_port":{"type":"UInt16","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.binding_port.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.binding_port.help","enum_set":"flowio_binding_port_digital_output","label":"Sortie physique (relais)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.binding_port.label","help":"Relais physique piloté par cette fonction. « Non connecté » laisse la sortie inerte. Le changement est pris en compte au prochain démarrage.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.binding_port.help"},"io/output/d17/d17_active_high":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_active_high.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_active_high.help","label":"Actif à 1 (état volet)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_active_high.label","help":"Si vrai, la sortie état volet est active à l'état haut; sinon active-bas.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_active_high.help"},"io/output/d17/d17_initial_on":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_initial_on.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_initial_on.help","label":"État initial ON (état volet)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_initial_on.label","help":"État appliqué au démarrage pour la sortie état volet (D17).","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_initial_on.help"},"io/output/d17/d17_momentary":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_momentary.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_momentary.help","label":"Mode impulsion (état volet)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_momentary.label","help":"Active un fonctionnement impulsionnel pour la sortie état volet (D17).","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_momentary.help"},"io/output/d17/d17_name":{"type":"CharArray","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_name.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_name.help","label":"Nom sortie état volet","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_name.label","help":"Nom lisible de la sortie état volet (D17).","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_name.help"},"io/output/d17/d17_pulse_ms":{"type":"Int32","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_pulse_ms.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_pulse_ms.help","unit":"ms","label":"Durée impulsion état volet (ms)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_pulse_ms.label","help":"Durée de l'impulsion automatique de la sortie état volet (D17).","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.d17_pulse_ms.help"},"io/output/d17/retain_on_warm_reboot":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.retain_on_warm_reboot.help","enum_set":"io_output_boot_behavior","label":"Comportement au reboot (état volet)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help":"Choisit si la sortie état volet (D17) applique son état initial au démarrage ou tente de conserver le latch matériel lors d'un reboot chaud. Sur MCP23017, la conservation est ignorée et l'état initial est appliqué.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d17.retain_on_warm_reboot.help"}},"meta":{}}